{"id":"28c39f1dc8b3e62b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-implicitly-definable.md","title":"Implicitly Definable","display":"df-implicitly-definable — Implicitly Definable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-implicitly-definable","aliases":["92-df-implicitly-definable"],"display":"df-implicitly-definable — Implicitly Definable","depends_on":["[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-implicitly-definable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-implicitly-definable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implicitly-definable — Implicitly Definable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;=L\\cup\\{P\\}\">\\(L&#39;=L\\cup\\{P\\}\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is a fixed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>-ary relation symbol not in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> (theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> (structure class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\models_{L&#39;}\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)\\)</span> (definition-target implicit-definability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicitly\\text{-}definable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{L&#39;}T\\land\\mathfrak N\\models_{L&#39;}T\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L\n\\Longrightarrow P^{\\mathfrak M}=P^{\\mathfrak N}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicitly\\text{-}definable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{L&#39;}T\\land\\mathfrak N\\models_{L&#39;}T\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L\n\\Longrightarrow P^{\\mathfrak M}=P^{\\mathfrak N}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>隐式可定义：唯一满足条件</li>\n<li>不直接给出定义公式</li>\n<li>给出条件，唯一集合满足</li>\n<li>等式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L\\)</span>同时固定共同底集与全部旧符号解释；比较的是同一<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构上的两个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-扩张</li>\n<li>隐式定义<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neq\">\\(\\neq\\)</span>显式定义</li>\n<li>一阶Beth可定义性定理说明：在标准一阶语义下，上述相对于理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的隐式可定义性蕴含由某个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-公式显式定义；跨越到二阶语义或其他逻辑时不能直接套用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L'}$ (theory, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struc}_{L'}$ (structure class, see [[92-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excer